\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Come and dwell in me,
\par Spirit of power within!
\par And bring the glorious liberty\tab 
\par From sorrow, fear, and sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The seed of sin's disease,
\par Spirit of health, remove,
\par Spirit of finished holiness,
\par Spirit of perfect love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Hasten the joyful day
\par Which shall be my sins consume,
\par When old things shall be passed away,
\par And all things new become.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I want the witness, Lord,
\par That all I do is right,
\par According to Thy will and word,
\par Well-pleasing in Thy sight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. I ask no higher state;
\par Indulge me but in this,
\par And soon or later then translate
\par To my eternal bliss.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

